682
00:27:12.063 --> 00:27:14.420
Oh, I didn't know that.
Yeah, and then he did it.

683
00:27:14.420 --> 00:27:15.253
Wow.

684
00:27:15.253 --> 00:27:16.290
With this data as part of it.

685
00:27:16.290 --> 00:27:19.130
But he's not like a boisterous,

686
00:27:19.130 --> 00:27:22.980
like he's a very soft-spoken, like, sweet guy.

687
00:27:22.980 --> 00:27:23.813
Yes.

688
00:27:23.813 --> 00:27:26.700
But they're hardcore, man, these guys.

689
00:27:26.700 --> 00:27:28.190
Like, they wanna win bad.

690
00:27:28.190 --> 00:27:32.110
And so it'll be interesting to see what happens

691
00:27:33.160 --> 00:27:34.000
in St. George.

