00:27:34.000 --> 00:27:35.500
I'm hoping to be there.

693
00:27:35.500 --> 00:27:38.530
And the funniest part about that story was,

694
00:27:38.530 --> 00:27:40.710
when I talked to Olav, he's so smart.

