00:27:50.240 --> 00:27:52.540
over three different times over a period of time

702
00:27:52.540 --> 00:27:54.397
before I fully kinda wrap my head,

703
00:27:54.397 --> 00:27:55.630
"How do I make this simple?

704
00:27:55.630 --> 00:27:57.097
How do I make it engaging,"

705
00:27:58.260 --> 00:27:59.890
because it's all so engaging.

706
00:27:59.890 --> 00:28:01.340
How do you kinda pair it down?

707
00:28:01.340 --> 00:28:03.350
And so that's what it took for me.

708
00:28:03.350 --> 00:28:07.170
And it's pretty funny, like how much you have to,

