2634
01:51:00.490 --> 01:51:02.360
I'll just eat it like a bowl of soup.

2635
01:51:02.360 --> 01:51:03.680
I can do that for you.

2636
01:51:03.680 --> 01:51:05.820
Like a Shakespearean era stew.

2637
01:51:07.660 --> 01:51:08.960
Back to the Shakespeare.

2638
01:51:11.090 --> 01:51:11.923
So I don't know.

2639
01:51:11.923 --> 01:51:16.390
Like I said, probably a very unsatisfactory answer for Sam.

2640
01:51:16.390 --> 01:51:17.573
But that's the truth.

2641
01:51:20.770 --> 01:51:21.603
That's a great answer.

2642
01:51:21.603 --> 01:51:23.700
I think that's totally real.

2643
01:51:23.700 --> 01:51:28.700
I, too, do not have a one particular hero that I look to

2644
01:51:28.740 --> 01:51:31.103
in times of strife.

2645
01:51:32.500 --> 01:51:36.490
But I do consult with Tao Te Ching on a regular basis,

2646
01:51:36.490 --> 01:51:37.730
if not at daily basis.

2647
01:51:37.730 --> 01:51:42.183
I have a yoga practice I try to do almost, I do daily,

2648
01:51:43.110 --> 01:51:46.370
lately it's been daily again, which is great,

2649
01:51:46.370 --> 01:51:49.700
and then I read a verse from Tao Te Ching,

2650
01:51:49.700 --> 01:51:52.170
which I've said on this podcast before,

2651
01:51:52.170 --> 01:51:56.473
and I contemplate it, I could be on one verse for 12 days,

2652
01:51:56.473 --> 01:51:58.300
I could be on one verse for a day.

2653
01:51:58.300 --> 01:52:01.000
So it just depends on my moment

2654
01:52:01.000 --> 01:52:02.187
and what's happening in my life

2655
01:52:02.187 --> 01:52:04.033
and that kinda keeps me oriented.

2656
01:52:05.040 --> 01:52:08.440
But another thing that I think about a lot is the Stoics,

2657
01:52:08.440 --> 01:52:12.180
because I get "The Daily Stoic" on my Instagram feed.

2658
01:52:12.180 --> 01:52:14.160
And it's not like I, I've never even read the book,

2659
01:52:14.160 --> 01:52:17.600
that's a huge hit by the way, Ryan Holiday's book.

2660
01:52:17.600 --> 01:52:22.440
But the idea of stoicism is something that I've,

2661
01:52:22.440 --> 01:52:26.610
I completely dovetail with and like

2662
01:52:26.610 --> 01:52:28.090
and the idea that you're here,

2663
01:52:28.090 --> 01:52:31.190
you're not here to have everything, the easy, or enjoyable.

2664
01:52:31.190 --> 01:52:34.210
And that wisdom from another age

2665
01:52:34.210 --> 01:52:36.055
is kind of my answer to that.

2666
01:52:36.055 --> 01:52:41.055
If it's the Tao, if it's "Daily Stoic" or whatever it is.

2667
01:52:41.450 --> 01:52:44.650
Because unlike you, I'm fortunate enough to be able to,

2668
01:52:44.650 --> 01:52:48.210
for my job, interview people who've done amazing things

2669
01:52:48.210 --> 01:52:49.980
and they are amazing human beings

2670
01:52:49.980 --> 01:52:53.173
and I do think about what I've learned from them as well.

2671
01:52:54.290 --> 01:52:56.390
And it's nice to have advice from friends.

2672
01:52:58.070 --> 01:53:01.203
But for me, like, that's what keeps me oriented.

2673
01:53:03.340 --> 01:53:07.340
If we're gonna expand this response to institutions

2674
01:53:07.340 --> 01:53:09.810
and literature, yeah, I would agree with that.

2675
01:53:09.810 --> 01:53:12.313
Marcus Aurelius, Epictetus,

2676
01:53:13.330 --> 01:53:16.160
Alcoholics Anonymous, the Group Conscience.

2677
01:53:16.160 --> 01:53:17.890
Bill Shakespeare.

2678
01:53:17.890 --> 01:53:19.143
Back to Shakespeare.

2679
01:53:20.690 --> 01:53:25.690
Yes, let your need for inspiration and wisdom

2680
01:53:27.150 --> 01:53:28.860
lead you where it may.

2681
01:53:28.860 --> 01:53:30.480
Bob Marley.
There you go.

2682
01:53:30.480 --> 01:53:33.880
All right, let's do the last question and tie this thing up.

2683
01:53:33.880 --> 01:53:35.100
Let's wrap a bow on it.

2684
01:53:35.100 --> 01:53:36.680
I thought we were gonna get under two hours,

2685
01:53:36.680 --> 01:53:38.200
but I don't think so.
No.

2686
01:53:38.200 --> 01:53:39.360
I'm too wordy.

2687
01:53:39.360 --> 01:53:40.860
All right, so the last one,

2688
01:53:40.860 --> 01:53:43.823
I'll play it on my phone for you, then we'll download it.

2689
01:53:46.260 --> 01:53:48.970
It's someone that you may have heard of.

