Hey, Rich.

2691
01:53:49.803 --> 01:53:50.703
Hi, Adam.

2692
01:53:51.900 --> 01:53:54.960
I'm calling just because I've been feeling

2693
01:53:54.960 --> 01:53:59.650
like in a bit of a slump lately when it comes to running.

2694
01:53:59.650 --> 01:54:04.650
In the last week or so, I just haven't felt motivated

2695
01:54:05.200 --> 01:54:08.130
or even like enjoyed running.

2696
01:54:08.130 --> 01:54:11.520
To give you some context, I have been training

2697
01:54:11.520 --> 01:54:14.150
for the last six months, five days a week

2698
01:54:14.150 --> 01:54:19.150
