2702
01:54:25.930 --> 01:54:28.560
Is it like taking some time off

2703
01:54:28.560 --> 01:54:30.130
or is it pushing through it

2704
01:54:30.130 --> 01:54:34.390
and just hoping I end up liking it again?

2705
01:54:34.390 --> 01:54:36.440
I wanna continue running

2706
01:54:36.440 --> 01:54:39.100
to maintain the fitness that I've gained,

2707
01:54:39.100 --> 01:54:42.950
but I just haven't been keen to get into it lately.

2708
01:54:42.950 --> 01:54:44.970
Anyway, we'd love to hear your thoughts.

2709
01:54:44.970 --> 01:54:46.620
Thanks.

