2846
02:00:06.930 --> 02:00:07.763
Please don't.

2847
02:00:07.763 --> 02:00:08.596
Nobody wants to,

2848
02:00:08.596 --> 02:00:11.136
nobody tunes in here.
You indulgent Westsider.

2849
02:00:11.136 --> 02:00:11.969
Right.

2850
02:00:11.969 --> 02:00:14.690
