2852
02:00:19.830 --> 02:00:23.099
without me knowing how to, have you ever figured that,

2853
02:00:23.099 --> 02:00:24.318
have you, do you have a nest?

2854
02:00:24.318 --> 02:00:26.035
Listen, Adam, suffering is suffering.

2855
02:00:26.035 --> 02:00:28.846
No, I don't have a nest, no.

2856
02:00:28.846 --> 02:00:29.679
The nest is winning.

2857
