2861
02:00:44.314 --> 02:00:45.780
And The Young Turks can make fun of you.

2862
02:00:45.780 --> 02:00:49.470
As appealing as that role sounds,

2863
02:00:49.470 --> 02:00:50.760
I'm gonna pass on that.

2864
02:00:50.760 --> 02:00:52.523
No nest in the tents.

2865
02:00:54.340 --> 02:00:56.020
It's nest-free nest.

2866
02:00:56.020 --> 02:00:57.290
You know what would be interesting

2867
